flowchart LR
    OP((Operator))

    P1[1.0 Authentication]
    P2[2.0 Simulation Engine<br/>Orchestrator]
    P3[3.0 Incident Detection]
    P4[4.0 Resource Allocation]
    P5[5.0 Evaluation]
    P6[6.0 Analytics]
    P7[7.0 Report Generator]
    P8[8.0 Smart Suggestions]

    D1[(D1 Users)]
    D2[(D2 Simulation Runs)]
    D3[(D3 Incidents)]
    D4[(D4 Agent Logs)]
    D5[(D5 Run Logs)]
    D6[(D6 Run Metrics)]
    D7[(D7 ML Models)]
    D8[(D8 Input Dataset<br/>input_data.json)]

    OP -->|credentials| P1
    P1 -->|auth result| OP
    P1 <-->|read / write| D1

    OP -->|seed · strategy · start run| P2
    P2 -->|run status · live updates| OP
    P2 -->|create_run · complete_run| D2
    P2 -->|read| D8
    P2 --> P3
    P3 --> P4
    P4 --> P5

    P3 -->|read model meta| D7
    P3 -->|write incidents · agent_logs| D3
    P3 -->|write| D4
    P2 -->|write state transitions| D5
    P4 -->|update routing · write| D3
    P4 -->|write| D4
    P5 -->|write| D4
    P5 -->|write metrics| D6
    P5 -->|complete_run| D2

    OP -->|request summary| P6
    P6 -->|analytics| OP
    P6 -->|read| D2
    P6 -->|read| D3
    P6 -->|read| D6

    OP -->|request export| P7
    P7 -->|CSV / PDF| OP
    P7 -->|read| D3
    P7 -->|read| D6
    P7 -->|read| D2

    OP -->|request suggestions| P8
    P8 -->|recommendations| OP
    P8 -->|read| D2
    P8 -->|read| D6
